<title>FINLAND: Partek to sell Dutch precast concrete unit.</title>
<headline>Partek to sell Dutch precast concrete unit.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish construction materials and cargo handling equipment group Partek said on Monday it had reached a preliminary agreement to sell its Dutch Schokbeton precast concrete unit to Voorbij Group for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale will not have a significant effect on Partek's result,&quot; Partek said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The company is not listed separately among Partek's subsidiaries in its 1996 annual report.</p>
<p>Partek said it was withdrawing from Schokbeton since the precast concrete products had little synergy with other companies in the business area.</p>
<p>The sale was due to be completed by October, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
